==History==
2016
*The Arrows [[Cards|card]] was added with [[Version History#Softlaunch on iOS (4/1/2016)|Clash Royale's game launch]] on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]] decreased the Arrows' Damage by 4%.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]] decreased the Arrows’ [[:Category:Tower Troop Cards|Crown Tower]] Damage to 40% of their full Damage (from 50%).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level Cap to 13 (from 12).
2017
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March 2017 Update (13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], increased the Arrows' Projectile Speed to 800 (from 600). It also slightly changed its card description. It used to say, ''“Arrows pepper a large area, damaging everyone hit. Reduced damage to Crown Towers.''”.
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]] decreased the Arrows’ Crown Tower Damage to 35% of their full Damage (from 40%).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan Wars Update (25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]] allowed the Arrows to be played directly on the river.
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]] fixed a bug where troops that were spawned after their parent [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] died would be immune to [[:Category:Spell Cards|Spell]] Damage.
*On 12/12/2018, an [[Version History#Optional Update (12/12/2018)|Optional Update]] fixed an issue where Arrows' [[Star Points|Star Levels]] used the sound effects of [[Goblin Barrel]].
2019
*On 3/6/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2019)|Balance Update]] increased the Arrows' Projectile Speed to 1100 (from 800).
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End of November 2019 Update (26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], decreased the Arrows' Damage by 58%, but made them damage troops in three volleys of Arrows instead of one, causing their Total Damage to be increased by 23%. It also added a card render to the Arrows' card info screen.
2020
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]] decreased the Arrows' Crown Tower Damage to 30% of their full Damage (from 35%).
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions Update (27/10/2021)|Champions Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022 
*On 27/6/2022, the [[Version History#Summer 2022 Update (27/6/2022)|Summer 2022 Update]] added the No Escape [[Card Mastery]] task for the Arrows.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022 Quarter 3 Update (26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]] changed the Arrows' behavior so that they deals damage in multiple 1.4-tiles areas instead of one 4-tiles area. This was done to prevent [[Monk]] from deflecting the entirety of Arrows. Its effective Attack Radius remained unchanged.
*On 27/10/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (27/10/2022)|maintenance break]] re-added missing visual effects for Arrows' Star Levels.
2023 
*On 27/3/2023, the [[Version History#Losers Update (27/3/2023)|Losers Update]] fixed an issue where Arrows dealt double damage to [[King's Tower|Mega King Towers]] in [[2v2]].
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card Evolution Update (19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 6/8/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2024)|Balance Update]] decreased the Arrows' Crown Tower Damage to 25% of their full damage (from 30%).
2025
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]] decreased the Arrows' Attack Radius to 3.5 tiles (from 4 tiles).
*On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15).
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update decreased the Arrows' Crown Tower Damage to 20% of their full damage (from 25%)

